Create Declarative Pipeline Job:
New Item > Pipeline > Name: First-Declarative-Pipeline.
Definition: Pipeline script > Paste generated syntax.
Best Practices: Use agent any, stages, error handling with try-catch.
Guidance: Start simple, then add PMD stage.
Write Pipeline Code:
