Solution

Expected Outcome: Pipeline runs stages sequentially; fails on PMD violations.
Pipeline Script (Jenkinsfile):groovypipeline {
    agent any
    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git url: 'https://github.com/<user>/my-maven-repo.git', branch: 'main'
            }
        }
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean compile'
            }
        }
        stage('Code Review') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn pmd:pmd'
                pmd canRunOnFailed=true
            }
            post {
                always {
                    pmdArchive '**/pmd.xml'
                }
            }
        }
        stage('Test') {  // Downstream equivalent
            steps {
                sh 'mvn test'
            }
        }
    }
}
Verification: Run pipeline > Blue Ocean view shows stage timeline. PMD archives XML for trends.
Common Issues & Fixes: Syntax errors—use Generator. Solution: Validate with jenkins-cli validate-pipeline.
